TIP:  For the intro just pluck the note eight times.  Untransposedd it's the open 1st string.  (If the note transposes you may have to fret the note.)

TIP:  At two points, prior to the first "It's just no . . ." and again at the coda to end the song, you'll see |Em| - |Em| - |Em| - <f#>-|G|.  Using downstrokes strum |Em| three times, then (untransposed) reach up with your middle finger and cover the top string/2nd fret <f#> and strum/pick the top string once on the way to one strum of |G|.  Then resume normal chord strumming with the (G).  At the coda you end with at single strum of |G|.
 
    
